# Physical crouch (VR Controls): the player's own head goes down and Ratchet crouches, comes up and he stands. Seen from
# outside and from his eyes; QUEST_STATE_TRACE=1 logs the game's state (4 is its crouch), "[vr-body] physical crouch" each
# change. A small dip does nothing, looking down does nothing, the stick still walks, a jump from low is the game's own.
600 y 1
606 y 0
2400 shot stand
# Looking at the floor alone is no crouch.
2420 head_pitch -70
2421 head_y -0.19
2520 shot lookdown
2530 head_pitch 0
2531 head_y 0
# A dip under the height: nothing.
2600 head_y -0.15
2700 shot dip
2710 head_y 0
2800 head_y -0.35
2900 shot low
2910 view_free 1
2911 view_z -1.3
2912 view_y -0.2
2913 view_yaw 180
2970 shot lowout
2980 view_free 0
# Walking while low.
3000 left_y 1
3120 shot lowwalk
3130 left_y 0
3200 shot lowstill
# A jump from low: the game's high jump.
3300 a 1
3306 a 0
3360 shot lowjump
3500 shot landed
# Up again.
3600 head_y -0.20
3700 shot partway
3710 head_y 0
3800 shot up
3900 quit 0
